        ],
        "text": "According to Eric D. Miller, in an individual\u2011capacity action against a government employee, the judgment is not enforceable against the government, so sovereign immunity does not attach."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
