            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan questioned why the rule should not apply when the State pays, suggesting it should be treated as a suit against the State."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
