            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked what language the Court might write that would affect official immunity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f869b1b1e4b9-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito inquired whether any argument exists in favor of official immunity in this case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f869b1b1e4b9-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked why a tribal employee driving a limo should be entitled to official immunity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f869b1b1e4b9-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 52,
              "start": 52
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether any decision precludes treating the case as sovereign immunity based on an indemnification agreement."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f869b1b1e4b9-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned why, if the tribe waived sovereign immunity, the individual should not be treated the same way."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f869b1b1e4b97621db3f42af5c77c3dfbb12cac2e2c2538b07dcd51e1be86fdf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f869b1b1e4b9-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether any court has held that an indemnification agreement extends sovereign immunity to the employee."
      }
