          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Katyal (Petitioner), mr. Katyal (Petitioner) argues that tribal employees should receive the same protections from suit as other sovereigns; if Clarke were a federal, state, or foreign employee, the suit would be barred."
        },
        {
